# Indicators of Compromise (IOCs)

Threat hunting frequently focuses on identifying Indicators of Compromise.

Examples include:

- Malicious IP addresses
- Suspicious domains
- File hashes
- Stolen credentials
- Unusual authentication activity
- Known attacker infrastructure

IOCs are often enriched using external Threat Intelligence feeds.

