# Key Takeaways

- Threat hunting is a proactive security activity focused on identifying hidden threats.
- Microsoft Sentinel provides powerful hunting capabilities through centralized telemetry and KQL.
- Successful hunts begin with a hypothesis and end with documented findings and improved detections.
- Threat hunting and detection engineering work together to strengthen an organization's security posture.

